## Cross-Model Routing
When native cross-model routing is available via registered Pi providers (e.g., pi-claude-bridge, pi-cursor-sdk), prefer `subagent` with a `model:` override over the `dispatch-external-model` skill for cross-model review and multi-model delegation. Use `dispatch-external-model` when no native provider covers the target model, or when the task requires the external CLI's own harness environment.
